<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?>
<MessageStudioText
	Format="1.2" xmlns="nintendo:msgstudio">
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_swleader1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チェレン『ナイス　タイミング　だね！▼
ヤグルマのもりの　なかで
プラズマだんを　みかけた……▼
そんな　じょうほうが　あってね
さがすのを　てつだってくれるかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:02:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:01" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チェレン『ナイス　タイミング　だね！▼
ヤグルマの森の　中で
プラズマ団を　みかけた……▼
そんな　情報が　あってね
探すのを　手伝ってくれるかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:02:32" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・posイベント
　GRIDX＝71～76、GRIDZ＝61
・連れ歩き確認
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→swchampion_03
　いいえ→swchampion_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-05T09:24:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:26" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_swleader1_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんにん　いるのか　わからないのに
べつべつに　こうどう　するのは▽
あまり　とくさく　とは　いえないよね▼
わかった！　きみの　じゅんびが
ととのうまで　ここで　まっているよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:11:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>何人　いるのか　わからないのに
別々に　行動するのは▽
あまり　得策とは　いえないよね▼
わかった！　きみの　準備が
整うまで　ここで　待っているよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:11:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・いいえ選択


・アニメ（足踏み：未発注）の可能性検討</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T07:39:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_swleader1_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ありがとう！▼
きみの　じつりょくを　まぢかで
はいけん　したいからね▽
きみに　ついていくと　しようかな▼
ポケモンの　かいふくは
ぼくに　まかせて　おいてよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:00:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ありがとう！▼
きみの　実力を　間近で
拝見したいからね▽
きみに　ついていくと　しようかな▼
ポケモンの　回復は
ぼくに　任せて　おいてよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:12:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい選択
・連れ歩き開始</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_swleader1_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チェレン『ストップ！▼
このまま　すすむと
ヤグルマのもり　から　でてしまう▼
ぼくたちの　もくてきは
プラズマだんを　さがすことだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T07:59:16" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チェレン『ストップ！▼
このまま　進むと
ヤグルマの森から　でてしまう▼
ぼくたちの　目的は
プラズマ団を　探すことだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:15:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・連れ歩き終了確認（出入り口のpos）
・スカイアロー側
　GRIDX＝71～76、GRIDZ＝61
・シッポウ側
　GRIDX＝80、GRIDZ＝73～78
・一歩戻される
</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T09:31:53" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_swleader1_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ひとも　ポケモンも
それぞれの　つよさを　もっている▼
ゆめを　かなえる　つよさや
なにかを　まもる　つよさ……▼
きっと　Ｎも　それが　わかったんだね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T05:23:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>人も　ポケモンも
それぞれの　強さを　持っている▼
夢を　かなえる　強さや
なにかを　まもる　強さ……▼
きっと　Ｎも　それを　理解したんだね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T05:23:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・振り向き会話その１</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:41" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_swleader1_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>プラズマだん……
というか　ゲーチス……▼
かれにとって　じぶんいがいの
そんざいは　ない　ものだったんだ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:54:47" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>プラズマ団……
というか　ゲーチス……▼
彼にとって　自分以外の　存在は
ないに　等しい　ものだったんだ……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:54:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・振り向き会話その２</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:45" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_swleader1_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ぼくの　りそうは　つよさ……▼
だけど　よのなかには　さまざまな
つよさが　あって　ただ　かつだけでは▽
もとめる　りそうには　たどりつかない</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:58:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ぼくの　理想は　強さ……▼
だけど　世の中には　様々な
強さが　あって　ただ　勝つだけでは▽
求める　理想には　たどりつかない</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:58:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・振り向き会話その３</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_swleader1_08"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きみを　みていると
ともだちを　おもいだすんだ▽
おおきな　つよさを　もっていたよ▼
……いまは　どこに　いて
なにを　考えているのかな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T05:31:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみを　みていると
友達を　思い出すんだ▽
大きな　強さを　もっていたよ▼
……今は　どこに　いて
なにを　考えているのかな</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T05:31:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・振り向き会話その４</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:48" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_swleader1_09"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>それにしても　プラズマだん　いないね
もっと　おくを　さがそうか</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:56:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>それにしても　プラズマ団　いないね
もっと　奥を　探そうか</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-12T03:56:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・振り向き会話その５
・以降、このメッセージを繰り返し</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:49" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_swleader1_10"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チェレン『それは　あなぬけのヒモ▼
こうかは　いっしゅんで　どうくつの
いりぐちに　とべる　どうぐ　だね▼
ということは　いま　つかわれると
ぼくたち　ばらばらに　なっちゃうよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-05T12:01:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チェレン『それは　あなぬけのヒモ▼
効果は　一瞬で　洞穴などの
入り口に　飛べる　道具だね▼
ということは　今　使われると
ぼくたち　ばらばらに　なっちゃうよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T05:37:15" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・禁則処理：道具「あなぬけのヒモ」</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:50" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:29" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#0080ff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_swleader1_11"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チェレン『あなをほるは　いっしゅんで
どうくつの　いりぐちに　とべる　わざ▼
ということは　いま　つかわれると
ぼくたち　ばらばらに　なっちゃうよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-05T11:58:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チェレン『あなをほるは　一瞬で
洞穴の　入り口に　飛べる　技▼
ということは　今　使われると
ぼくたち　ばらばらに　なっちゃうよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T05:37:38" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:05:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・禁則処理：わざ「あなをほる」</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T10:04:52" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER1
ジムリーダー・チェレン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
