	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_sportsm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンを　かいふく　させずに
ライモンから　とけいまわりに▼
イッシュを　いっしゅう　する
イッシュ　スパルタ　マラソン！！▽
こんど　ちょうせん　するつもりだよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:45:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンを　回復させずに
ライモンから　時計回りに▼
イッシュを　一周する
イッシュ　スパルタ　マラソン！！▽
今度　挑戦する　つもりだよ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:47:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:46:04" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_mountain_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もりを　まもるために
ばっさい……　ポケモンたちに▽
きを　きってもらうんだとよ▼
なんでも　きが　おおすぎると
ぜんぶの　きが　よわっちまうとか……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:57:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>森を　守るために
伐採……　ポケモンたちに▽
木を　切ってもらうんだとよ▼
なんでも　木が　多すぎると
全部の　木が　弱っちまうとか……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:58:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T08:57:32" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MOUNTAIN</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d02r0101_assistantw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>もりで　くらす　ポケモンたちも
こもれびが　すきだと　いいのにね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-06T09:13:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
